</code></pre>

Function Signature Description <code>cyg_mutex_init</code> <code>void cyg_mutex_init(cyg_mutex_t *mutex)</code> Initialize mutex <code>cyg_mutex_lock</code> <code>cyg_bool_t cyg_mutex_lock(cyg_mutex_t *mutex)</code> Lock (blocking) <code>cyg_mutex_trylock</code> <code>cyg_bool_t cyg_mutex_trylock(cyg_mutex_t *mutex)</code> Non-blocking attempt <code>cyg_mutex_unlock</code> <code>void cyg_mutex_unlock(cyg_mutex_t *mutex)</code> Unlock <code>cyg_mutex_destroy</code> <code>void cyg_mutex_destroy(cyg_mutex_t *mutex)</code> Destroy mutex <code>cyg_mutex_set_ceiling</code> <code>void cyg_mutex_set_ceiling(cyg_mutex_t *mutex, cyg_priority_t priority)</code> Set priority ceiling <code>cyg_mutex_set_protocol</code> <code>void cyg_mutex_set_protocol(cyg_mutex_t *mutex, enum cyg_mutex_protocol protocol)</code> Set NONE, INHERIT, or CEILING Mutex Pattern — Priority Inheritance<pre><code>cyg_mutex_t spi_mutex;
