Strategy <code>xQueueSend</code> call Behaviour when queue full Use case Drop timeout = 0 Return <code>errQUEUE_FULL</code>, discard item Streaming telemetry — old data is stale anyway Block timeout = portMAX_DELAY Producer blocks until space available Commands — every item must be processed Timed block timeout = N ticks Block up to N ticks, then drop with error Sensor data with soft deadline Overwrite <code>xQueueOverwrite()</code> Always writes; overwrites oldest item Setpoint/reference signals — only latest matters <pre><code>/* xQueueOverwrite: always posts, overwrites if full (queue length must be 1) */
QueueHandle_t xSetpointQ = xQueueCreate(1, sizeof(float));

